&lt;div style=&#34;text-align: center;&#34;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blog.pietrodn.com/slides/ai-intro-presentation-202604/&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apri il deck interattivo →&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
